<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b><span style="text-decoration: underline">Proposal 2: Appointment of MGO as the Company&#8217;s Independent
Registered Public Accounting Firm</span></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Company&#8217;s stockholders ratified the
appointment of Macias Gini &amp; O&#8217;Connell LLP (&#8220;MGO&#8221;) as the Company&#8217;s independent registered public accounting
firm for the year ending December 31, 2024. The final voting results are as follows:</p>

