<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b><span style="text-decoration: underline">Proposal 6: Adjournment Proposal</span></b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>&#160;</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">The Company&#8217;s stockholders approved the
adjournments of the Annual Meeting by the Company to permit further solicitation of proxies, if necessary or appropriate, if sufficient
votes were not represented at the Annual Meeting to approve the Proposals, by the following vote:</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><b>&#160;</b></p>

